        "definition": "ZVL-013\n\nHealth professional role. Multiple roles could be provided.\n\nBinding Description: (preferred): ISCO, SNOMED CT. De ISCO waardenlijst bevat \"occupations\" e.g. Nursing professional, Specialist Medical Practitioners.",
